- the heavy result on the final head: 258 of 258 steps green (PR body);
- the full quick plan on the trial merge with `main` c31384ae4: green;
- a new run on the trial merge with `main` 148a5c832, for what `main` changed after that (#3470, #3489, #3505 in `xtask/`): `cargo test -p xtask` 313 passed; the gpu suites 15 passed (lib 6, bin_parity 3, refusals 6); `cargo check -p camcraft-ui` green; clippy on `xtask` and `camcraft-gpu` green.

